BEGIN:VEVENT
DTSTART:20261211T183000
DTEND:20261211T210000
DTSTAMP:20261001T000000Z
UID:sapa-2026-12-11@sastamps.org
SUMMARY:SAPA Blue-Chip Auction
DESCRIPTION:SAPA's annual Blue-Chip Auction. Lots must have a catalog value of at least $20 (the opening bid may be lower). Each lot containing stamps must include the Scott (or other recognized) catalog number\, catalog value\, and catalog year\, and the condition must be described. Lots submitted before November 20 are verified by a panel of experts\; later lots\, including those submitted on auction night\, are not verified.
LOCATION:MacArthur Park Lutheran Church\, Building 1\, Fellowship Hall\, 2903 Nacogdoches Road\, San Antonio\, TX 78217
CATEGORIES:auction,blue-chip-auction,annual,buying,selling
STATUS:CONFIRMED
END:VEVENT

